,1030,1033,1036,1039,1041,1044,1046,1049,1052,1055,1057,1060,1062,1065,1067,1069,1072],{"class":684,"line":1029},20,[682,1031,1032],{"class":723},"    items",[682,1034,1035],{"class":696},":",[682,1037,1038],{"class":696}," [[",[682,1040,805],{"class":696},[682,1042,1043],{"class":808},"id",[682,1045,805],{"class":696},[682,1047,1048],{"class":696}," =>",[682,1050,1051],{"class":696}," '",[682,1053,1054],{"class":808},"one_off_product_3Qb8Wz1Yt",[682,1056,805],{"class":696},[682,1058,1059],{"class":696},",",[682,1061,1051],{"class":696},[682,1063,1064],{"class":808},"quantity",[682,1066,805],{"class":696},[682,1068,1048],{"class":696},[682,1070,1071],{"class":688}," 1",[682,1073,1074],{"class":696},"]],\n",[682,1076,1078,1081,1083,1086,1088,1090,1093,1095],{"class":684,"line":1077},21,[682,1079,1080],{"class":723},"    redirectUrlSuccess",[682,1082,1035],{"class":696},[682,1084,1085],{"class":787}," route",[682,1087,802],{"class":696},[682,1089,805],{"class":696},[682,1091,1092],{"class":808},"billing.success",[682,1094,805],{"class":696},[682,1096,1097],{"class":696},"),\n",[682,1099,1101,1104,1106,1108,1110,1112,1115,1117],{"class":684,"line":1100},22,[682,1102,1103],{"class":723},"    redirectUrlCanceled",[682,1105,1035],{"class":696},[682,1107,1085],{"class":787},[682,1109,802],{"class":696},[682,1111,805],{"class":696},[682,1113,1114],{"class":808},"billing",[682,1116,805],{"class":696},[682,1118,1097],{"class":696},[682,1120,1122],{"class":684,"line":1121},23,[682,1123,876],{"class":696},[682,1125,1127],{"class":684,"line":1126},24,[682,1128,713],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":712},[682,1130,1132],{"class":684,"line":1131},25,[682,1133,1134],{"class":763},"\u002F\u002F Receipts — hosted invoice URLs, no PDF plumbing\n",[682,1136,1138,1141,1143,1145,1147,1150,1153,1155,1158,1160],{"class":684,"line":1137},26,[682,1139,1140],{"class":848},"foreach",[682,1142,896],{"class":696},[682,1144,781],{"class":692},[682,1146,784],{"class":696},[682,1148,1149],{"class":692},"orders ",[682,1151,1152],{"class":696},"as",[682,1154,778],{"class":696},[682,1156,1157],{"class":692},"order",[682,1159,466],{"class":696},[682,1161,909],{"class":696},[682,1163,1165,1168,1170,1172,1174,1177],{"class":684,"line":1164},27,[682,1166,1167],{"class":787},"    echo",[682,1169,778],{"class":696},[682,1171,1157],{"class":692},[682,1173,784],{"class":696},[682,1175,1176],{"class":787},"invoiceUrl",[682,1178,838],{"class":696},[682,1180,1182],{"class":684,"line":1181},28,[682,1183,753],{"class":696},[250,1185,1186,1187,1189,1190,1192],{},"No VAT logic, no tax tables, no invoice templates, no client-side checkout widget to embed —\nthe checkout is a server-side redirect, like Stripe Checkout. See ",[288,1188,84],{"href":173},"\nand ",[288,1191,76],{"href":170}," for the full surface.",[317,1194],{},[320,1196,1198],{"id":1197},"feature-parity-and-whats-still-on-the-roadmap","Feature parity, and what's still on the roadmap",[250,1200,1201],{},"Vatly covers what a SaaS needs to start selling: subscriptions with trials, plan swaps,\ncancellation with grace and resume, one-off purchases, hosted checkout, refunds and chargebacks,\nand — because it's a Merchant of Record — VAT, invoicing and tax compliance handled for you. A\nfew capabilities you may use elsewhere aren't in the box yet. Here's the honest picture, and how\nto bridge it.",[325,1203,1204,1217],{},[328,1205,1206],{},[331,1207,1208,1211,1214],{},[334,1209,1210],{},"Capability",[334,1212,1213],{},"Vatly today",[334,1215,1216],{},"Notes",[351,1218,1219,1230,1242,1256,1265,1279,1295],{},[331,1220,1221,1224,1227],{},[356,1222,1223],{},"Subscriptions, trials, swap, grace, resume",[356,1225,1226],{},"✅",[356,1228,1229],{},"Full lifecycle, Cashier-shaped API",[331,1231,1232,1235,1237],{},[356,1233,1234],{},"One-off \u002F multi-item checkout",[356,1236,1226],{},[356,1238,1239],{},[254,1240,1241],{},"checkout()->create(items: …)",[331,1243,1244,1247,1249],{},[356,1245,1246],{},"VAT, invoicing, tax remittance",[356,1248,1226],{},[356,1250,1251,1252,1255],{},"Handled — it's the point of a MoR. With Cashier (classic Stripe Billing) this is ",[267,1253,1254],{},"your"," job.",[331,1257,1258,1260,1262],{},[356,1259,599],{},[356,1261,1226],{},[356,1263,1264],{},"First-class models + events (more than most provide)",[331,1266,1267,1270,1272],{},[356,1268,1269],{},"Test \u002F live segregation",[356,1271,1226],{},[356,1273,1274,1275,1278],{},"Every record carries ",[254,1276,1277],{},"testmode","; key prefix selects the mode",[331,1280,1281,1285,1288],{},[356,1282,1283],{},[272,1284,566],{},[356,1286,1287],{},"🔜 Roadmap",[356,1289,1290,1291,1294],{},"Until native codes land, model a promo as a dedicated ",[254,1292,1293],{},"subscription_plan_…"," at the discounted price and point that cohort at it. A couple of extra plans in the dashboard — not a blocker for launching offers.",[331,1296,1297,1301,1303],{},[356,1298,1299],{},[272,1300,583],{},[356,1302,1287],{},[356,1304,1305,1306,1308,1309,1312],{},"Vatly is built for SaaS, where entitlement follows subscription state — ",[254,1307,260],{}," ",[267,1310,1311],{},"is"," your license check. Per-seat keys for downloadable\u002Foffline software (Lemon Squeezy's signature feature) aren't here yet. If you ship license-activated desktop binaries, that's the one workflow to keep elsewhere for now.",[250,1314,1315],{},"The shape of the trade is deliberate: Vatly does the compliance-heavy core that's genuinely\nhard to build — being the seller of record, VAT across the EU, invoicing, disputes — and is\nfilling in the conveniences (coupons next) in the open. For a subscription SaaS selling into\nEurope and the world, there's enough here to launch today.",[317,1317],{},[320,1319,1321],{"id":1320},"why-teams-choose-vatly","Why teams choose Vatly",[250,1323,1324,1325,1328],{},"A Merchant of Record makes the tax burden disappear — it becomes the legal seller, so VAT,\ninvoicing and remittance stop being your problem. The real question is ",[267,1326,1327],{},"whose"," entity you hand that\nto, and that's where Vatly stands apart:",[1330,1331,1332,1338,1344],"ul",{},[635,1333,1334,1337],{},[272,1335,1336],{},"Europe-first, by design."," EEA-based, EU jurisdiction, customer data kept in Europe. The other\nMoRs sit in the UK (Paddle) or the US (Lemon Squeezy, Stripe Managed Payments) — jurisdiction is\nthe one axis that genuinely separates them, and the reason Vatly exists.",[635,1339,1340,1343],{},[272,1341,1342],{},"No exposure to US policy."," Your seller-of-record relationship and your customers' data stay\nunder EU law — a clean answer when an enterprise buyer, or your own board, asks where they sit.",[635,1345,1346,1349],{},[272,1347,1348],{},"One familiar API."," The Cashier-shaped surface means there's little to learn and little to\nrewrite.",[1351,1352,1353],"blockquote",{},[250,1354,1355],{},[272,1356,1357],{},"You Just Ship.",[317,1359],{},[320,1361,1363],{"id":1362},"next-steps","Next steps",[1330,1365,1366,1376,1384],{},[635,1367,1368,1371,1372,1375],{},[272,1369,1370],{},"Starting fresh"," → ",[288,1373,1374],{"href":164},"Getting started"," wires up the trait, config, migrations and\nwebhook in a few minutes.",[635,1377,1378,1371,1381,1383],{},[272,1379,1380],{},"Already running another provider",[288,1382,186],{"href":187},"\nshows how to add Vatly beside your current biller and migrate customers over gradually.",[635,1385,1386,1371,1389,1391,1392,1391,1394,1391,1396,1391,1398,1391,1400],{},[272,1387,1388],{},"Reference",[288,1390,190],{"href":191}," · ",[288,1393,64],{"href":167},[288,1395,76],{"href":170},[288,1397,84],{"href":173},[288,1399,92],{"href":176},[288,1401,46],{"href":179},[250,1403,1404,1405,1408,1409,1408,1412,1415],{},"Compared against, at time of writing:\n",[288,1406,293],{"href":290,"rel":1407},[292]," ·\n",[288,1410,298],{"href":296,"rel":1411},[292],[288,1413,304],{"href":302,"rel":1414},[292],".\nTheir method names and table layouts follow those packages' current releases 